1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,120
What did they do?

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,550
They did not rely on their reasoning.

3
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:03,650
This mind of yours

4
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:06,480
is the greatest obstacle
to your miracle.

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,850
Take note of this today.

6
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,250
This intellect of yours

7
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:12,050
is the greatest obstacle
to your miracle.

8
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:15,050
Combine your intellect
with faith.

9
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:15,950
Hallelujah!

10
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:18,650
I will follow God's Word.

11
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,080
If I obey God's Word,

12
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,912
then God will fulfill
His promises.
